target/

# The Maven wrapper is committed on purpose — mvnw, mvnw.cmd and
# maven-wrapper.properties together are what pin the Maven version, and CI
# invokes ./mvnw precisely so it does not inherit the runner image's own
# (older, broken for this project) Maven. Ignoring the properties file, as
# this list used to, would leave the wrapper unable to resolve a distribution
# at all. distributionType=only-script means there is no jar to worry about.

### IDE ###
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
.vscode/
.classpath
.project
.settings/

### Logs ###
*.log

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Env ###
.env
